{"id":"d65efe7c4f987bfe","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-signedgraph.md","title":"Finite signed graph","display":"df-signedgraph — Finite signed graph","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-signedgraph","aliases":["27-df-signedgraph"],"display":"df-signedgraph — Finite signed graph","depends_on":["[[27-df-binom2]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§5.5.3","source_statement":"Signed graph preceding Equation (5.7)","source_printed_pages":"220","source_pdf_pages":"244","verification_status":"source-definition-checked","local_review_status":"2026-10-20-formalization-reviewed-source-text-not-rechecked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-signedgraph"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-signedgraph</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-signedgraph — Finite signed graph"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"87fcc2e909cc2731\" href=\"?note=87fcc2e909cc2731\" title=\"27-df-binom2\">27-df-binom2</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§5.5.3"},{"key":"source_statement","html":"Signed graph preceding Equation (5.7)"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"220"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"244"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-definition-checked"},{"key":"local_review_status","html":"2026-10-20-formalization-reviewed-source-text-not-rechecked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G^\\sigma=(V,E^+,E^-)\">\\(G^\\sigma=(V,E^+,E^-)\\)</span> 为集合的有序三元组；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\binom V2\">\\(\\binom V2\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"87fcc2e909cc2731\" href=\"?note=87fcc2e909cc2731\" title=\"27-df-binom2\">27-df-binom2</a>）。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SignedGraph}\">\\(\\mathrm{SignedGraph}\\)</span> 是本节定义的一元谓词符号。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SignedGraph}(G^\\sigma)\\Longleftrightarrow|V|&lt;\\infty\\land E^+\\subseteq\\binom V2\\land E^-\\subseteq\\binom V2\\land E^+\\cap E^-=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{SignedGraph}(G^\\sigma)\\Longleftrightarrow|V|&lt;\\infty\\land E^+\\subseteq\\binom V2\\land E^-\\subseteq\\binom V2\\land E^+\\cap E^-=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 §5.5.3：边集由正边和负边不交划分。此处明确有限性；原式遗漏该条件。允许空图，底层边集为 E<sup>+∪E</sup>-。此谓词采用 loopless 版本。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-binom2","status":"resolved","id":"87fcc2e909cc2731","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-binom2]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-binom2","status":"resolved","id":"87fcc2e909cc2731","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$G^\\sigma=(V,E^+,E^-)$ 为集合的有序三元组；$\\binom V2$（see [[27-df-binom2]]）。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"G^\\sigma=(V,E^+,E^-)","display":false},{"tex":"\\binom V2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SignedGraph}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SignedGraph}(G^\\sigma)\\Longleftrightarrow|V|<\\infty\\land E^+\\subseteq\\binom V2\\land E^-\\subseteq\\binom V2\\land E^+\\cap E^-=\\varnothing.","display":true}],"bytes":1304,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-341","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-df-signedgraph|df-signedgraph — Finite signed graph]]"},{"id":"a7fb4b198985f03a","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$N=[n]$，$\\mathrm{SignedGraph}((N,P,M))$，见 [[27-df-signedgraph]]；$\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}$。$\\mathrm{Bal}$ 为有限符号图上的三元谓词，$\\mathbf1_M:\\mathcal P(N)\\to\\mathbb B$ 与 $s_{P,M}:\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb B$ 由下式定义；模 $2$ 同余取整数含义。"}],"outgoing":["87fcc2e909cc2731"]}